#: ../../source/design.rst:11
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "Paquetes"

#: ../../source/design.rst:13
msgid "All data in PartCAD is bundled into 'packages'."
msgstr "Todos los datos en PartCAD se agrupan en 'paquetes'."

#: ../../source/design.rst:15
msgid ""
"Packages are organized in a hierarchical structure where some packages "
"may define \"dependencies\" that become \"child\" packages. The top-level"
" package is called \"//\". If a package called \"//package\" has a "
"dependency called \"sub-package\" then such a sub-package will be called "
"\"//package/sub-package\"."
msgstr ""
"Los paquetes se organizan en una estructura jerárquica donde algunos "
"paquetes pueden definir \"dependencias\" que se convierten en paquetes "
"\"hijos\". El paquete de nivel superior se llama \"//\". Si un paquete "
"llamado \"//package\" tiene una dependencia llamada \"sub-package\", "
"entonces ese subpaquete se llamará \"//package/sub-package\"."

#: ../../source/design.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each package is described using the configuration file ``partcad.yaml`` "
"placed in the package folder."
msgstr ""
"Cada paquete se describe mediante el archivo de configuración "
"``partcad.yaml`` ubicado en la carpeta del paquete."

#: ../../source/design.rst:25
msgid "Sketches"
msgstr "Bocetos"

#: ../../source/design.rst:27
msgid ""
"PartCAD uses 2D sketches to create 3D models (e.g. via `extrude` or "
"`sweep`) and to maintain various metadata (such as the geometry of "
"interfaces between parts, arbitrary part metadata like camera view angles"
" and so on)."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD usa bocetos 2D para crear modelos 3D (por ejemplo, mediante "
"`extrude` o `sweep`) y para mantener diversos metadatos (como la "
"geometría de las interfaces entre piezas, metadatos arbitrarios de la "
"pieza como los ángulos de vista de cámara, etc.)."

#: ../../source/design.rst:31
msgid "Basic shapes"
msgstr "Formas básicas"

#: ../../source/design.rst:33
msgid "Outer shape: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"
msgstr "Forma exterior: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"

#: ../../source/design.rst:34
msgid "Optional inner shape: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"
msgstr "Forma interior opcional: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"

